 "words_heard": 279,
 "words": 281,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Paul stood in the middle of the Areopagus",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saw the city full of idols all around",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He looked at the objects of their worship",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And found an altar with a hidden sound",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To an unknown god it was inscribed",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "What you worship in ignorance I will explain",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The God who made the world and everything in it",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Does not live in temples made by human hands",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He gives everyone life and breath and all things",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From one man he made every nation",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To seek God and perhaps reach out for him",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Though he is not far from any one of us",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In him we live and move and have our being",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We are his offspring as the poets say",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So we ought not to think that the divine being",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Is like gold or silver shaped by human skill",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God overlooked the times of ignorance past",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But now he commands all people to repent",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He has set a day to judge the world with justice",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By the man he has appointed for the end",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He has given proof of this to everyone",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By raising him from the dead in glory's light",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In him we live and move and have our being",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We are his offspring as the poets say",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So we ought not to think that the divine being",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Is like gold or silver shaped by human skill",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Some began to mock when they heard of the resurrection",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But others said we will hear you again",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Damaris joined him and came to believe",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A woman from Athens in the center of the plan",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And others with them believed in the risen Lord",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The gospel reached the mind and the heart of man",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  }
 ],
